<title>USA: EquiMed says its president steps down.</title>
<headline>EquiMed says its president steps down.</headline>
<dateline>STATE COLLEGE, Pa. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>EquiMed Inc said Thursday president Larry Pearson is leaving the company to become chief executive of privately-held Comprehensive Medical Management of New York.</p>
<p>The company has not yet appointed a replacement, a spokesman said.</p>
